For the FFmpeg/WebAssembly component, the corresponding source contains the
wrapper and build recipe under wasm/, docker/, and compose.yaml. Exact upstream
source versions are pinned by docker/Dockerfile. The repository tag matching
the Maven artifact version is the corresponding source snapshot and can
rebuild/relink the WebAssembly artifact. See LGPL_RELINKING.md.
